\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1408575-questions-about-something-like-money-shaman-paradigm?p=1408758#post1408758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because Coyote is a shifty trickster and universally untrusted by anyone with a lick of sense.</div> </div> </div> </div>Including Nuwisha themselves, like Weeps-With-Joy haha","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26367-wickedone","name":"WickedOne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T12:51:23-07:00","id":1408769,"title":"","content":"The Dreamspeakers faction known as the Ghost Wheel Society includes shaman who deal with monetary and financial spirits, among other modern ones.<br /> <br /> The Chaos Magic that House Thig used to specialize in included the use of modern symbols and ideas in substitution for more classic Hermetic ones, including modern money and credit in place of the tarot suit of coins, and various modern icons in place of classic ones. <br /> <br /> As far as classic Kabbalism intersecting with modern finance, see the movie Pi. <br /> <br /> St. Matthew the Apostle is the one connected to financial affairs. <br /> <br /> As for totems, one could always go with The Invisible Hand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T15:57:18-07:00","id":1408799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1408575-questions-about-something-like-money-shaman-paradigm?p=1408769#post1408769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Dreamspeakers faction known as the Ghost Wheel Society includes shaman who deal with monetary and financial spirits, among other modern ones.<br /> <br /> The Chaos Magic that House Thig used to specialize in included the use of modern symbols and ideas in substitution for more classic Hermetic ones, including modern money and credit in place of the tarot suit of coins, and various modern icons in place of classic ones.<br /> <br /> As far as classic Kabbalism intersecting with modern finance, see the movie Pi.<br /> <br /> St. Matthew the Apostle is the one connected to financial affairs.<br /> <br /> As for totems, one could always go with The Invisible Hand.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes, he'll be with the Ghost Wheel Society. Thank you to your suggestions!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26367-wickedone","name":"WickedOne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}